{"beat": 31, "name": "THE DIME IN YOUR CATALOGUE", "text": "Now your business. You have a dime. Probably several. A price you set once, for a reason that made sense at the time: a round number, a competitor's price, your cost times a markup, whatever the last product sold for. And it's been working, so you've left it alone. That's what Woolworth's company did for more than 50 years: it worked, so it stayed. And it carries the same blind spot. As long as that price doesn't move, your sales history can't tell you what a different one would do. Not a little. Nothing.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "Now", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.22}, {"word": "your", "start": 0.22, "end": 0.44}, {"word": "business.", "start": 0.44, "end": 0.82}, {"word": "You", "start": 1.4, "end": 1.56}, {"word": "have", "start": 1.56, "end": 1.72}, {"word": "a", "start": 1.72, "end": 1.84}, {"word": "dime.", "start": 1.84, "end": 2.2}, {"word": "Probably", "start": 2.48, "end": 2.82}, {"word": "several.", "start": 2.82, "end": 3.3}, {"word": "A", "start": 3.94, "end": 4.08}, {"word": "price", "start": 4.08, "end": 4.36}, {"word": "you", "start": 4.36, "end": 4.62}, {"word": "set", "start": 4.62, "end": 4.86}, {"word": "once,", "start": 4.86, "end": 5.18}, {"word": "for", "start": 5.18, "end": 5.46}, {"word": "a", "start": 5.46, "end": 5.6}, {"word": "reason", "start": 5.6, "end": 5.9}, {"word": "that", "start": 5.9, "end": 6.16}, {"word": "made", "start": 6.16, "end": 6.4}, {"word": "sense", "start": 6.4, "end": 6.68}, {"word": "at", "start": 6.68, "end": 6.9}, {"word": "the", "start": 6.9, "end": 7.0}, {"word": "time:", "start": 7.0, "end": 7.42}, {"word": "a", "start": 7.88, "end": 8.0}, {"word": "round", "start": 8.0, "end": 8.36}, {"word": "number,", "start": 8.36, "end": 8.78}, {"word": "a", "start": 8.88, "end": 8.96}, {"word": "competitor's", "start": 8.96, "end": 9.6}, {"word": "price,", "start": 9.6, "end": 9.94}, {"word": "your", "start": 10.32, "end": 10.42}, {"word": "cost"